Description: Limit WWAN disconnect requests to the bearers activated by NetworkManager
 Other modem clients can have independent data connections, including the
 IMS bearer used for calls. Simple.Disconnect("/") tears those down as well.
 Keep the bearer returned by Simple.Connect until disconnect consumes it.
 .
 If deactivation races Simple.Connect, wait for its reply and disconnect
 the bearer it returns. Keep the bearer until ModemManager acknowledges
 release, and serialize a new connection with this cleanup.
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-27

